To find all paths with empty comments, we need to iterate over each path and check if its comment is not empty.

Here's how you could do it:

```java
import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        List<String> paths = Arrays.asList("/path1", "/path2");
        
        Map<String, Set<String>> commentsEmptyPaths = new HashMap<>();
        
        for (String path : paths) {
            if (!commentsEmptyPaths.containsKey(path)) {
                commentsEmptyPaths.put(path, new HashSet<>());
            }
            
            commentsEmptyPaths.get(path).add("");
        }

        List<String> allCommentsEmptyPaths = new ArrayList<>();
        for (Map.Entry<String, Set<String>> entry : commentsEmptyPaths.entrySet()) {
            for (String comment : entry.getValue()) {
                allCommentsEmptyPaths.add(comment);
            }
        }

        System.out.println(allCommentsEmptyPaths.size());
    }
}
```

